    <mxCell id="an_bad_T140" value="&lt;div style='width:414px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#991B1B;'&gt;✕ PUSHING ON A LOCKED DOOR:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;Demanding $40k more Base when HR band strictly caps at $205k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#FECACA;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="140" width="424" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="an_good_T140" value="&lt;div style='width:426px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#065F46;'&gt;✓ PULLING RSU + SIGN-ON LEVERS:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;+$20k Base + $42k/yr RSUs + $20k Sign-On&lt;/b&gt; = instant VP approval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="462" y="140" width="434" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="of_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;#1 COMP MISTAKE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Base-Only Fixation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Giving Your Number First or Debating Base Salary Alone&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Base bands have rigid HR ceilings (+8–10%), whereas &lt;b&gt;RSU equity &amp;amp; sign-on pools flex +80–140%&lt;/b&gt; for strong AI hires.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;$93k/yr Left on Table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="of_tr" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#059669;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;COLLABORATIVE LEVERAGE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#D1FAE5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;0% Rescind Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Trade Commitment Certainty for Total-Comp Flexibility&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Say: &lt;i&gt;&amp;ldquo;Team X is my #1 choice — if we can bridge total comp to $328k via RSUs + sign-on, I will sign within 24 hours.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;+39% Average Lift w/ 2 Offers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="of_bot" value="&lt;div style='width:832px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;background:#F8FAFC;border:1.4px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:16px;padding:9px 13px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;MNEMONIC: O · F · F · E · R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#ECFDF5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Comp Playbook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Outlast 1st Anchor • Frame Total 4-Yr Comp • Flex RSUs When Base Caps • Earn Sign-On Bridge • Request 6-Mo Promo Check&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Never negotiate before written numbers arrive; batch all 4 levers in &lt;b&gt;one calm, data-backed email&lt;/b&gt; so your recruiter can win VP sign-off.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="788" width="836" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c1_T140" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#059669;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;◆ 30s STAFF+ INTERVIEW PITCH&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&amp;ldquo;Anchor on &lt;b&gt;4-year Total Compensation&lt;/b&gt;: when base caps out, bridge the gap via &lt;b&gt;top-of-band RSUs, sign-on &amp;amp; a 6-month level review&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c2_T140" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F766E;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;▲ DAY-1 GCP ⇄ OSS STACK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Parallel Loop Synchronization + Written Comp Packet&lt;/b&gt; ⇄ Levels.fyi / Public Pay Bands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="323" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c3_T140" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#047857;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;★ L5 → L7 PROMO IMPACT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;Negotiating into the &lt;b&gt;upper quartile of L5/L6&lt;/b&gt; accelerates your next promo packet timeline&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

